     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi,</div><div><br></div><div>Wondering if anyone can suggest a solution for the following:</div><div>- render a different .html or .md file depending on user input;</div><div>-- i.e.</div><div><br><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">renderHTML</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;$filename.html&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderMarkdown</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;$filename.md&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span></span></div></code></div><br>-- where $filename is defined by a widget, e.g. <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/widget-gallery.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/widget-gallery.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401828033000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1a8KXC-RVauYLwMnNKRnpK\">radio buttons</a>, from which:</div><div>(1) server.R receives input$radio and passes the value to ui.R;</div><div>(2) ui.R then renders the appropriate file.</div><div><br></div><div>I can achieve (1) of course, and ui.R will print the &quot;value&quot; received from server.R, but I cannot figure out (2): how to pass &quot;value&quot; to renderHTML() or renderMarkdown. Can anyone help? I&#39;ve tried out Dynamic UI and Reactive Programming but these haven&#39;t led me to the solution; perhaps this is the right track though?</div><div><br></div><div>many thanks, Andrew</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Reproducible example below:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"color:#800\">##ui.R</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></font><p><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">markdown</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  radioButtons</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;radio&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> h3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Radio buttons&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Choice 1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;foo1.md&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Choice 2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;foo2.md&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> selected </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;foo1.md&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  hr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  fluidRow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">column</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    verbatimTextOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;value&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    includeMarkdown</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">textOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;value&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#800\"># same outcome with verbatimTextOutput()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></span></p></div></code></div><br><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"color:#800\">##server.R</span></font><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p><span style=\"color:#000\">shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  output$value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderPrint</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$radio </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#800\"># same outcome with renderText()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></span></p></div></code></div><br>Markdown files can be something trivial like:</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"color:#800\">## foo1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Hello</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">World</span><span style=\"color:#660\">!</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">from</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> foo1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">md</span></font></div></code></div><br><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\">## foo2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Hello</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">World</span><span style=\"color:#660\">!</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">from</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> foo1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">md<br></span></div></code></div><br>If I run this Shiny App, the error message is as follows: &quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">invalid &#39;description&#39; argument</span>&quot;</div><div><br></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>"
